IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLAIM02.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY CLAIM.
COPY POLICY.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLAIM-REC POLICY-REC.
    IF POLICY-STATUS NOT = 'ACTIVE'
        MOVE 'REJECTED' TO CLAIM-STATUS
    ELSE
        COMPUTE CLAIM-APPROVED =
            FUNCTION MIN(CLAIM-REQUESTED POLICY-COVER)
        IF CLAIM-APPROVED > 200000
            MOVE 'MANUAL_REVIEW' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        ELSE
            MOVE 'APPROVED' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        END-IF
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
